<description>&lt;p&gt;Baghdad has closed the Sheeb border crossing with Iran amid US pressure, while Iranian officials deny Iraqi claims of expelling Kurdish opposition from the area. Israeli fighter jets conducted drills in Iraqi airspace near the Iranian border, and US and Israel are reported to be preparing new strikes against Iran following the midterm elections. Logistics efforts are underway to resupply warships engaged in the Iran war, indicating broader regional military activity. The conflict recorded 396 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxQbkFuYUExaW9ZSzZaVkgtQkNsX2pUWGhpckhVWVR4dGZoQUhGdzA1QW0zWkNIVVBBaDdUUVhvcVM4UU5wUS1BaVJvQnUzM2NUTXR0U1pPNWJNUzZJSGVwLTJDX0s1c25fVEp5Y1Zfc3ptTS1tMVNUUWloSmFsUzI1S08xb0QtU0JEa3F6b1hOLU5sc09yYWVFU2hINmgtWmkxaGk1T2F2dWJiZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;ASHARQ AL-AWSAT English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxPWldYb3RpMllaRnFYRTRVemRQdHEzdU11d0lNR2VxR1VabVZUUkpqekxmWGhVRWdfTWNvMEdIWncyanpYM2tITnFwLVBzdExvOWNzWWZEUEo0Q19TeUxPRVFQQXlFamt0aDVILS02UDI3eHJxM0s3a1hjU2I1TTM2TzBiNlZ0bWRQcGRIZ3hZLWZteWM4UFpRX0JWWUtRbGhxVTdKRVVCSkgyQjJOamgwOEtucWZhc2ttMEtfWDNCUDFGc3V1cGc3dA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Montgomery Advertiser&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.okaz.com.sa/politics/na/2271857&quot;&gt;okaz.com.sa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.israelnationalnews.com/news/434980&quot;&gt;israelnationalnews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.london-now.co.uk/news/26656584.poppy-appeal-2026---joanna-lumley-launches-london-event/&quot;&gt;london-now.co.uk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.eurasiareview.com/21102026-remembering-epic-battle-of-altun-kupri-prde-oped/&quot;&gt;eurasiareview.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wral.com/news/state/fact-check-trump-midterm-ral